## Local Configuration Template
# Copy this file to local.properties and fill in your SDK directory and Supabase credentials.

# Location of the Android SDK
sdk.dir=/path/to/your/Android/sdk

# Supabase backend credentials (used for data collection sync and authentication)
SUPABASE_URL=https://your-supabase-instance.url/
SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your_supabase_anon_public_key

# Package name of both apps (optional). Change it only for a samsung build distributed under your
# own Samsung Health partnership; it must match the package name registered there.
# ENPULSE_APPLICATION_ID=org.example.yourstudy
